  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電子商務安全",
    "sub_ename": "E-COMMERCE SECURITY",
    "describe_ch": "分成四個部份； 第一部份定義電子商務，區分電子商務與電子企業營運與定義不同型態的電子商務。第二部份說明電子商務的科技基礎建設與軟、硬體的安全措施。第三部份探討在電子商務發展的過程中商業、社會與法律上所產生的議題。最後比較零售、服務、企業對企業、拍賣入口網站、社群。 與數位媒體等的真實電子商務經驗。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is organized into three parts. In the first part, we introduce the model of electronic commerce and its applications. Secondly, we discuss the security threat and crucial challenge in developing an e-commerce application. Finally, we explain how to solve these problems according to cryptographic techniques.",
    "pre_subname": "IECS3052密碼學、IEE1000計算機概論(一)、IEE1001計算機概論(二)、IECS1005計算機概論、IECS1001計算機概論與實習(I)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IECS3052",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IECS3052 CRYPTOGRAPHY、IEE1000 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER(1)、IEE1001 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER(2)、IECS1005 INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING、IECS1001 INTRODUCTION TO COMPUTER SCIENCE AND ITS PRACTICE(I)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
